// card wasmtime-ffi step D: the module lib/compiler/emitter.warp emitted (`WARP_SELF_HOSTED=1 warp compile --wasm
// 'print "hi from emitter.warp"; 6 * 7'` writes it to out.wasm) runs through Homebrew's libwasmtime (lib/wasmtime.warp)
